VMQALoCNQoZChNjb20ubWFnaWN3YXIuZ3Auc2VhEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"The great Dragon is gone, sacrificed to stop the Demon King. Now, only a hidden dragon egg holds the last hope for the magical continent. But the enemy is returning—and they will stop at nothing to destroy it.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe egg’s light flickers. The enemy gathers. Will you be the shield or the sword?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Just Flick \\u0026amp; Kill\\u003cbr\\u003eAuto-targeting knives circle your hero, shredding through monster waves.\\u003cbr\\u003eJust swipe and watch the magic happen. The best part? No aiming needed – perfect for playing on the bus or during boring meetings!\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Tower Defense Challenge\\u003cbr\\u003eTest your tactics in special Tower Defense missions—build mage towers, artillery, and traps to hold off waves of monsters.\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock unique bonus to turn the tide when all seems lost.\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Strategic Kingdom Building\\u003cbr\\u003eRebuild ruined cities and design impregnable defenses.\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery wall, tower, and gate matters—one breach could doom the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Epic Heroes \\u0026amp; Dragon Magic\\u003cbr\\u003eCommand legendary warriors, each with dragon-forged abilities.\\u003cbr\\u003eUpgrade heroes to unleash cataclysmic ultimate skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Real-Time War\\u003cbr\\u003eMonsters attack without warning. Adapt or perish.\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up for large-scale co-op sieges against nightmare bosses.\"],\"K3GAMES\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l8AMkCEEVzhz1aWvrspafP-hMDJE0GbtESXi0kk0B4sPR0QI6WSKaqfjqKdjEAawAd7kUEeGiSpD-wccziZ-\"],null,[224,189,126,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u0