LVKyj_XKpaaEPcMpIxa8rX2BIZDnLo2PNwVYjo79WspFJ-HyFN8V8RahcCSA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lWLCBOacKjAyKoFnhgRyQopXuJmfI0u0IuaTgyfovkOg8gZqDP493_nMKLOhaT8yyQcM8dLITANTrxikrOX2\"]]],\"Just Desserts: Revenge \\u0026 Merge\",[\"4.8\",4.76699],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIC0oTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQodChdjb20uanVzdGRlc3NlcnRzLmdsb2JhbBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Step into the enchanting town of Frostvale, where sweetness masks dark secrets! Join talented pastry chef Ella as she returns to her hometown to uncover the truth behind a mysterious fire. Merge desserts to restore your family’s beloved pastry shop and dig past the icing to reveal long-buried truths.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake Desserts\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge ingredients like powdered sugar and butter to whip up delicious cookies! Upgrade your recipes to unlock exquisite delights, including the elegant Swan Cake. The more you create, the more delectable treats you\\u0026#39;ll discover!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRebuild the Pastry Shop\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTransform your family’s charred shop into a magnificent dream space! Choose vintage tiles, glowing neon signs, and exquisite furniture to design a shop that reflects your style. Each area you rebuild unveils new plot clues.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReconnect with the Past\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReunite with Edward, your former lover. Is he your unexpected savior or an accomplice to the arson? As rivals appear, what schemes lie behind their charming smiles? Explore your mother’s mysterious recipe and the secrets of that fateful night!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUncover the Truth\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGather clues from the night of the fire through decorating and merging! Piece together charred photographs, shattered ledgers, and cryptic notes. Can you unravel the family secret that someone is desperate to keep hidden?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWarning: In this small town, the sweetest smiles often hide the deadliest lies.\"],\"Century Games Innovation Pte. Ltd.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LrS9usanUwoVuvA4gHc-r2VRH5UWJfy7g0O2k6eTnnBKk-Ti5xHnzGZlwFUPNjYAXC-wFTuP1i1B3CYD7skCojg\"],null,[141,110,114,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"₱55.00 - ₱5,990.00 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bj-jc9ay6gZVvpMYA8cBVvY2Gt9056AAJrJORsfNz8zWRFOzUGU-_NuP3Z9MMHhe5xElvV3l1afYpq7VSnAsW2s\"],null,[58,48,46,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wwXJZWIfwJINtcT99AbFsBZgiPBwPsINuFldC4LGCjk14oHihXk-Z0KEm9uVkO8d7xEW9fbWKokSIpm8nCl-aA\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hrGVX3gz3Awad5kwqpt_n45_saPqtmdzE0Ly9rbLuAgixVwXIrVU8EJVoOJl0x8QA7f-VCryab5pgj4ZAPd1\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6SsoP-ts9rtfdvNMH90IR9n540b6wqyeJ581Wn_RnvcgjJANjlWaKXINFL6fJqF2ZwuzJEy50W5JnViaCO0Z\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c_YBaeStqeTjRmGTygE3OuyrOlMavoqwx4PQWkC801-13Ip1rpd91kSBzrFAWDelyM18ToSMSnuuiHj-Xzs9\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SJa3T8dZjdho_bFd2ytlj-E69g_LRREqOmO7gC_TDyMmVaeeUUopw7d9FQOVHuJpD0cntLOh_UcZC9-c2emm\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5ccus18OzxBzLMNPAyXuuW6fULV7bRacpk5_eIxPyCguqgSH36QGsvpAXM4Z1kqwalg1pVZgjIU6jzqSx5ODkA\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2PZJR7XjGopRCHsvOI8cIAxSKdSjZF-dFJVS5-X5IZj_WJ0dYs53YhV2MeGHsvsc6VW74DBfLdg2Je6Nws3Pq0s\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VuUJBmJPXkTAmF87wz3z4t0ewaH5xes3Z0QkI5Dr7VqZeUHaB5Dz1cYkhT8r8eouHNVDX4PMzAQuG_BythZU\"]]],\"Haunted Merge: Horror Story\",[\"4.9\",4.8834953],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIDEoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPQohChtjb20ud2hhbGVqb3kuaG9ycm9yc3RvcnkuZ3AQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"IgTaB-tShew\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezljeCY7tIKCf6k9Ai1_swro5RGIQwMSDsxHrbO7KrfLPbSBKNmCBlOS_8-Ihd6kGrLAwlK5gsIO0pmtRRaO1W4vyzEUauA41_GaRDmkWahim4datAV0SseTngyiWg3yYzK2p837psIHtGwDvl4cFINPKL_09RGyv0L_EAo_XB8uAI08Fg8lceFVA_ZzHxG9x8Og04Bok4aCLb1BUp4MwPMKQ9TSRPCaKEiu7ziNC2psQTlSjXp2qLUPGs917U5Wh3ZXlVN0jKygqzWsbAMzGcI9WtjEK0sGIC0rxOKRlibHeQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IgTaB-tShew/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;You don\\u0026#39;t see them... but they see you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re an orphan, raised by a wandering feng shui master who found you near a graveyard. Before he died, he handed you a locked box—the only clue to your past. After burying him, you begin your journey to uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eYour first lead brings you to a run-down apartment building. You move in as a tenant—but something is deeply wrong.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The elevator opens by itself—on floors no one pressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- An empty unit echoes with whispers that don’t exist.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A cursed construction site keeps taking lives...\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat starts as a ghost story becomes something far more disturbing.\\u003cbr\\u003eBecause sometimes, the real horror isn’t the ghost—it’s the people.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eFace your fears and uncover long-buried secrets\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge clues to reveal hidden truths\\u003cbr\\u003eLook closely - every detail could crack the case\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve puzzles and relax through a hauntingly original experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDare to look deeper?\\u003cbr\\u003eYour parents are gone. But why?\\u003cbr\\u003eIs it a curse… or a cover-up?\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you tell what’s real - and what’s a setup?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe deaths keep coming. Accidents? Or something worse?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for players who:\\u003cbr\\u003eLove creepy folktales and chilling mysteries\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy merge mechanics with a twist\\u003cbr\\u003eAre drawn to stories about the dark side of human nature\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is your only way out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Haunted Merge: Horror Story\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge the evidence. Uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eExpose the terrifying secrets buried behind every story they tried to erase.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/HauntedMergeGames\"],\"WhaleJoy Game Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0J-mq5H4QCThfEQvEoKHXaxMMob0O6a0FxJfT5WvqXTbBLOtZwwhmy3eewvCOJkmznnuykYnYu424DPKBYUq5w\"],null,[18,20,18,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Horror\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,nu