/play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X6CHppPWOwQuccciYiD4pOwuV0M3przBFMQX_Fz8nkY61WHW9vpJT2RUqGA7XpkFZrm8BG2J1CI7lOZjNloJ9Q\"]],[null,2,[1536,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VVUIq7_MxFDGVyxE0Kc9WEBP_zEAY-aZoGKPfQ_3AUtYMmUOq3CL6TryOpnoX0Gq7iKByExqz3jtMNXI347q4Q\"]],[null,2,[1536,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AgOgKEYXorLZHdMgoP3On__Hp9lG34PCXm1l0gCGZbuiSYM56lxBz8eNsWgU9nleVr0q2gTjAJCp0-dU1snF\"]],[null,2,[1536,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Cz6cr-tU1iVq7SLzoEHYqO51FUQIiDlYh-mxiMJBkQYUgj81l1CP5pm_ixPcxZXldH6flwgSC86EnP1pCu_3\"]],[null,2,[1536,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J0JJLmfR7eEnWys9hEh_lN_0c-gvPGtAlhJj5ulEwGJmVfcdPYbzLBbbBKnFNpVLRp7-m78SykaJR9ASl8z1\"]]],\"Family Island™ — Farming game\",[\"4.7\",4.6684766],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.MelsoftGames.FamilyIslandFarm\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.MelsoftGames.FamilyIslandFarm\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.MelsoftGames.FamilyIslandFarm\"]],[\"qgJxGm8IDUoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQwonCiFjb20uTWVsc29mdEdhbWVzLkZhbWlseUlzbGFuZEZhcm0QARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Immerse yourself in an unforgettable world of adventure with a modern Stone Age family!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImagine what your life would be without modern technology, what would you do? Perhaps you would explore territories, build houses or even entire villages; farm, harvest, or maybe you would conquer new lands.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou have an opportunity to be on a desert island together with the heroes of the Family Island game and try yourself in different roles: farmer, cook, explorer, trader and many others. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eInterested? Here are some more features of our game:\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eExplore\\u003c/b\\u003e  wild territories, solve puzzles, find hidden objects and  set on a thrilling adventure to new islands.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eBuild\\u003c/b\\u003e and improve your little city in the middle of the ocean.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eStart your own family farm!\\u003c/b\\u003e Harvest, grow crops and craft useful goods to trade with other characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eCook\\u003c/b\\u003e healthy and tasty food from the ingredients that you can find on the island.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eCustomize\\u003c/b\\u003e your village with beautiful decorations! Choose flowers and plants that match the unusual landscapes of your village.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eMeet\\u003c/b\\u003e unusual animals: island hamsters, wild goats and even a dinosaur are waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eHelp\\u003c/b\\u003e a family survive on a desert island. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnd that is not all! Family Island is a farm game full of unexpected twists and captivating adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Family Island on Facebook and Instagram for exclusive offers and bonuses!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: facebook.com/familyislandgame/\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: instagram.com/familyislandgame/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/terms.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/privacy.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game contains in-game purchases (including randomized items)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Our support is ready and waiting at:  https://melsoft-games.helpshift.com/hc/en/11-family-island/\"],\"Melsoft Games Ltd\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yW-Q0E-ntIf0KbcaTf