jv_uozv77e0jbgXJfNyCoYBG3ogIzk_CFxHJTQIdq8Sk\"]],[null,2,[2028,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hFTwETm_2OLR-XyWgGeD390Wsf8IG49zfZ6zNrj8yaUHUWYroPPNobAxcJPAAnFDz_y3cuazi6JjppDR0pgA3Gs\"]],[null,2,[2028,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yTWaLuVgHiXrwlQwVTm7tmSAoE7D1SlN_PrU_OD6eCgy-T2DtYjBcqzCPtKHq7FNtV5VsQRe7UXrSIDU3a8urW4\"]],[null,2,[2028,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3AiUE7X64QX10VFpeGxbfrXQ4oaTD65jS_RRTj-ezzrx8L7hzhS6h8-upM2aNX9vMuVttFSLbEBJJR59wdZTaA\"]],[null,2,[2028,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Utfwb6TG4L27cOZOptOcmI-0VoZ7o4h-P4C9MIaDFncarQT2jpGM9b5MgDevTXQ_a0QweYX9q488I1yY9PsGmw\"]]],\"Farm Heroes Saga\",[\"4.8\",4.7622795],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIFkoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQodChdjb20ua2luZy5mYXJtaGVyb2Vzc2FnYRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"3YEUylysADQ\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:3YEUylysADQ?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:3YEUylysADQ\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkHGco7yS0MVoUPJunGZdVj_RTdUyKDjfc5xO_vohIKCgLbTztN-p7MbDGNQhZozNCFOLmfMG_2ScocQ-dI7LsUv-9epkBrt0IfnV7K216I07mclu_iu89M2iP_jaUIEDSFU1vZXPk6G1mwRAk6cwVYYEzcrqwaAyJY1xvMwwNRKDpRhwB-POEPdrYy6JnskIbMvnn9pvq73GJFtxWRmK1YjoDL0oQo3pdh-P1VcISVrIWWnGExsxSxSb8VOSWfsEm0JR06LRlhCRH3Yxc4ORZLLG3Gquvycqszcm5GOUZplg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3YEUylysADQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Farm Heroes Saga, from the makers of Candy Crush Saga, Pet Rescue Saga, and Bubble Witch 3 Saga!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarming has never been so fun! Jump into a farmtastic adventure: match and collect the cute Cropsies across the farm to solve the match 3 puzzles! Go from puzzle to puzzle, matching fruit and plants, and level up to save the farm from Rancid the Raccoon. Join forces with the Farm Heroes to swap, match, and collect Cropsies. Ready to defend the Farm Lands?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the amazing farm and match 3 puzzle game from King! Match 3 or more Cropsies in a variety of game modes and puzzles. Unlock animals and blast boosters as you solve the different match 3 puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore 1000’s of Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eAcres of luscious levels and puzzles await you! Every two weeks, discover new puzzles, for a match 3 game in constant evolution!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHero Mode\\u003cbr\\u003eTime for a blast! Match as many Cropsies as you can before running out of moves. The higher the score, the more Magic Beans you gain to help you win the puzzle game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRancid Boss Battles\\u003cbr\\u003eDefend your farm! Solve challenging matching puzzles and, with the help of the farm animals, keep the thief away from your fruit and plants. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the Farm Club\\u003cbr\\u003eRecruit cute animals to help you solve puzzles! When matching is not enough anymore, call your animal friends to the rescue and blast powerful boosters to win the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with friends…\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with your friends to enhance your farming experience: chat, play with them and participate in events unique to Farm Teams. Who said the farming adventure had to be lonely?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e…or compete with friends!\\u003cbr\\u003eYou think your farm is the best? The game is on! Compete in the leaderboard or in the Tractor Dash event to prove you’re the best at match 3 puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart matching and farming Cropsies today! But most importantly, have fun playing Farm Heroes Saga!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://community.king.com/en or contact us in game by going to Settings \\u0026gt; Customer Care if you need help!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Saga is free to play but optional in-game items such as extra moves or lives require payment. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device’s settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading Farm Heroes Saga you agree to our terms of service which can be found at https://king.com/termsAndConditions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help center or by going to https://soporto.king.com/contact\"],\"King\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/j3czn91O4kwAk1Kto5AR3DhiwaZxEDhta3AeTz212FR44sBGFl57zYIoA2x-TVMLueE8mISALGq__AZ7EzyGQM0\"],null,[180,238,233,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, Shares Info, Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"₱49.00 - ₱13,250.00 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.vng.playtogether\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/37tT1iybfdrKxmYJifO1f9r8r4rJChqKvqHBipX_Dm8RaWI0eHtOZi1iHJYBv_EBsC7fWgpYauHIlGsiawGU\"],null,[11,11,12,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hjvvQ88LCpcmoD20Ziy-Kgq6HpJGt4C2wj1uCtJ4QGQvs13xqSn3H6usZFYx3QIIhKMics7M8YdprY98DzfsxA\"]],[null,2,[1242,2688],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/95J6F9x0smqMgBamZ_tfQ-SktUZexb-LQ9n-zBs2NEMWiA7Sn81o68wYI-oV7N49MR_MWd2xYea0vX1g9PrOeQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2688],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VSRg_RlZ-_jkpYlIUbFYzjaPV9lMBZU5RyWqf1HtdAbsJu10I6eWHJMCJNCSQfqJYQOS0nCmUFwmzIEEPIaxEGc\"]],[null,2,[1242,2688],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0fR7smhenHYp_0BxOOTvv_TW0f2dwsf8lsg-DSi9mDAL7c4gVKcEd8EDCwoZ80jL4KbeSDkY6CMerO-bueXTkQ\"]]],\"Play Together VNG\",[\"3.8\",3.8019803],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vng.playtogether\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.vng.playtogether\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vng.playtogether\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIF0oTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20udm5nLnBsYXl0b2dldGhlchABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"gdWDnFwRQg0\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:gdWDnFwRQg0?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:gdWDnFwRQg0\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezn0RqCsoTJTlJpQ69mW8vWYdQ8oo2sfAwgE6tTNKYb4GgKcS1Ks6i6l06VUl3Scl7augTzBMcm0TAIvRT3tpqSRvG_bFAVq2oJRBUI1F75OvKCg2bO_31g8aHA5IrG-xFkzj_lueJ7PlkbzDciuzROG--eDcuNoGTuZSAJeCj7CtydlQFO3fpkAy8seJCcNUEtszqK6BdZziSB_UyFHn3MbXJVOtvUP-Zt50NPSTmBNY7AsKN9fTbnV-lKI1sozlGqqhQWGvHUMvhuLWP0gyJjhjmtXAS4WGcJJtai3H1hJbg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gdWDnFwRQg0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Create your avatar, make friends, and explore a cozy social world in one of the most fun virtual life simulator games.\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to PLAY TOGETHER, a vibrant virtual world full of fun mini games and social activities. Enjoy the game where you can dress up, decorate house, raise pets, and playtogether.\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate a character unique to you and meet all kinds of players.\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your character from head to toe in your own unique style. Enjoy the fun of avatar games and dress up games with endless options across skin tones, hairstyles, body types and costumes; the perfect look is waiting for you. You might even find friends like you, chat and connect around the world!\\u003cbr\\u003eTurn your humble abode into your dream house and invite friends over for a Home Party!\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose from a wide range of house styles and furnish every corner to bring your dream home to life. Invite others over or drop by theirs to fish, chat, and role-play together for fun! Decorate your house and enjoy a cozy life simulator experience with community.\\u003cbr\\u003eHave a blast playing fun-filled minigames with your squad.\\u003cbr\\u003eShow off skills in sandbox games like Game Party, where the last 30 players standing win, Zombie Virus, Obby Race, Tower of Infinity, Fashion Star Runway, Snowball Fight, Sky High, and many more exclusive school games. Explore and discover new fun games.\\u003cbr\\u003eGo around various fishing spots to catch new species of fish and show them off to others!\\u003cbr\\u003eReel in over 600 species across ponds, seas, and even swimming pools. New fish are constantly added, and every spot holds unique catches — complete them all in your Illustrated Book! Relax and enjoy casual games every day.\\u003cbr\\u003eCatch insects and lizards with your friends or go excavate rare ores and fossils.\\u003cbr\\u003eOver 300 insect species are thriving across the world. Dig up dinosaur fossils and rare diamonds, then sell your findings or display them proudly for all to see.\\u003cbr\\u003eTake good care of pets of all shapes and sizes.\\u003cbr\\u003eBring more joy to your life with adorable companions like puppies, kittens, and ponies that follow you. Take walks, cruise the streets and watch out for special limited-time pets available only during certain periods.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love avatar games, party games, decorating, school role-play or simulator games, PLAY TOGETHER brings everything into one online social game.\\u003cbr\\u003e[Please Note]\\u003cbr\\u003e●\\tFor our usage policy (including refunds \\u0026amp; termination of service), please read the Terms of Service listed in the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Use of illegal programs, modified apps, and other unauthorized methods to access the game may result in service restrictions, account removal, claims for damages, and other remedies under the Terms of Service.\\u003cbr\\u003e▶About App Access Permissions◀\\u003cbr\\u003eIn order to provide you with game services listed below, the app will ask you for permission to grant access as follows.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Required Permissions]\\u003cbr\\u003eAccess to Files/Media/Photos: This allows the game to save data on your device \\u0026amp; to store any gameplay footage or screenshots you take within the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[How to Revoke Permissions]\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Android 6.0 \\u0026amp; above: Device Settings \\u0026gt; Apps \\u0026gt; select app \\u0026gt; App Permissions \\u0026gt; grant or revoke permission\\u003cbr\\u003e▶ Below Android 6.0: Upgrade your OS version to revoke the access permissions as above or delete the app\\u003cbr\\u003e※ You can revoke your permission for the app to access game files from your device by following the instructions above.\\u003cbr\\u003e※ If you are using a device which runs below Android 6.0, you will not be able to set permissions manually so we recommend that you upgrade your OS to Android 6.0 or higher.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Caution]\\u003cbr\\u003eRevoking the required permissions may limit access to the game or stop game resources running on your device.\"],\"VNG GROUP JSC\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vzaF7MNjuvWvvPPH-yL4ldMn_nJqLaE4EHe75MupGRDzj2qlIjUJxWlnmGsz3QPGg1ZDm6xCKS48oMAxT51s1g\"],null,[119,173,67,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vng.playtogether\\u0026rdid