,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/483PXL0ZCzkgV4inw3vCaqtpKXJ3nKCUccrZf1vFRhlBQ5FqoEmViacmk6z6oe5raiG7aXEuQVXMHleXu6XU\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1ZjpobW0sdXmnfARVl5Ed4RQawQ9bZoO0GTQkCWOk9_OL7IZ9dKzVeLGTQ-0QIM2rVisyW5gylHPkhAAicCW\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o9ZJ1P2Y2lsitCmgjfx0gQPtWcyShhzgysUP4HwP-hfO-tq7SGuj2yGa5qKweYTIE5VXryDls2XCzQsVUmk\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w7PgXH_e2nqVhHqzm9vhg86BfyfLc9fNPw-UyWJb51dUvQVxPgFC1p5go8BPfRnkELWs7oj8uZLrCEP-Uxw9\"]]],\"Forest Match - Earn rewards\",[\"4.7\",4.703412],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.blazingappstudio.faerie_forest_frenzy\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.blazingappstudio.faerie_forest_frenzy\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.blazingappstudio.faerie_forest_frenzy\"]],[\"qgJ5GncIGEoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCSwovCiljb20uYmxhemluZ2FwcHN0dWRpby5mYWVyaWVfZm9yZXN0X2ZyZW56eRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"DGupf9u5BdM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:DGupf9u5BdM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:DGupf9u5BdM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmOq3MZu8QrhRda3kjbZ8TpStcghy_aM-XxUoQIftdQMYFmpSijPq-YfP17oJWEBvkaEby6fykcLFqTbVsuLVN6ZhRtV-mf85EZnKZJoQ8OJQ0xXm9jVImPtj-0gYb00udrQq0LIjPCrRrpzR6l86UPpwO_aSr-y_9sVVPCEUH4Y9NO-wS-H0wJBG7YXAoBM2L5KH2JkJATj0UhYC1qpT_dqjRYqI-7jFPW0wZHSb1N8OvA_CRc3Qf2DbRUKHhBLjunYjdtM4sxgk9fL7w6TtZ2yiArZCjLJxwTmmve3Z8Wbw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DGupf9u5BdM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003ch3\\u003e🌲 Forest Match - Play, Compete, Win \\u0026amp; Earn Rewards!\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with Finn, the forest leprechaun, and match forest items! Step into the enchanting woods in \\u003cb\\u003eForest Match\\u003c/b\\u003e and start playing today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e★ Everyone loves this popular match-3 game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ A fresh and fun way to relax and challenge yourself!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e✨ Match-3 Gameplay Made for Fun and Challenge\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eForest Match\\u003c/b\\u003e is an exciting \\u003cb\\u003ematch-3 puzzle game\\u003c/b\\u003e. Help Finn by matching all the forest treasures. Match your way to the top and prove you\\u0026#39;re the best player! 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow to Play?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Match 3 or more forest items to collect them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Match 4 items to earn extra time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Match 5 in a T or L shape to create a forest bomb.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ For every 4 items you match, you gain bonus time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Try to match as many as possible before time runs out!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e🌲 Game Features\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Easy to play but with a strategic twist.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Compete on \\u003cb\\u003edaily, weekly, and monthly leaderboards\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Earn \\u003cb\\u003eamazing rewards\\u003c/b\\u003e for topping the charts.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Use boosters to boost your position.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Stuck? Get auto hints to keep going.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Compete with \\u003cb\\u003efriends and players worldwide\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Collect mystery gifts as a loyal player.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e🕰️ When to Play?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ During short breaks or free moments.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ While commuting or waiting in line.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ On weekends or to unwind after a long day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ As a fun break from social media or other games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e🏆 Why Forest Match Stands Out\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eForest Match\\u003c/b\\u003e is more than a game—it\\u0026#39;s a delightful challenge. Whether you\\u0026#39;re climbing the leaderboard or just enjoying a match or two, it\\u0026#39;s the perfect combo of fun and focus. Easy to start, tough to master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e📥 Download Forest Match - Play, Compete \\u0026amp; Win!\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and help Finn collect forest treasures. Match, compete, and earn your spot on the leaderboard!\"],\"Blazing App Studio\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VFfqNo5sKny4J5yEQn1thDjWXwd7y4FzTqI-1Nf1h-KNyU9nRl6LopL5Sl7Gce0S2Xf2MTKhMhTvapTbmMZPgA\"],null,[234,131,28,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.c