732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d62Mq4yotX2J72EQ2muJJ9FO9EYfvBjgry3FeMswLds_r1WyBY_Kee5MUsR8WeMF9-Bk4k-5nX0oQTCZxvOD\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rUeRKXTIVGYAEQJld35z-XQWb2lziq2Y9iWYDjTc1_8mmZjw8Di4jRCTWZs6VtP_K4Gs4d7ER6oVCgu1zfG8jg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NYoqZpLjNZmpiaPQGsK2otPjkP-v25vtWTv9JNWpq9RL84_7y1hHOmIPIQqT1339-25mlWxJ2INgwWhG_IpSBA\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VROvn_qQx__P2J_e1gZPUkvhpXT2n4wWr5HPuO6HvW_e_pIPGJxRCcMUW1DuF8HoflfPulkrlxfV2SRzFQDC\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5nxU8KgRzGlnKbN8_IgL7665GFQkvAa59v9h3r-iKMALBF1XT5nvZIXRp7W3yQBYNMeiU4Mt0TpK0uHRBStSycY\"]]],\"Hunting Sniper\",[\"4.7\",4.7105265],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ru.huntingsniper\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ru.huntingsniper\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ru.huntingsniper\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIGUoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20ucnUuaHVudGluZ3NuaXBlchABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"q1DaZ9EBXhk\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:q1DaZ9EBXhk?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:q1DaZ9EBXhk\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk1dR9qV6gOjEdB82dVo7cI8nH1OW9MTnOmwz2Y2LzcfCtFcqy4rR3R3XGyOlEw3L9FI7Kn8yyDHkcLQy9X2WuBHUvisarvwqqBNIfY3yJerfQK8lBM-Zqs0E_AfyjHRcege49_iSgWf8jVMwFmrQTUWLCvo1X2c5Y-s6sQ4P6piZM3gSG6JQTsD0GwvrplB-IhhCixWPeNjKD-IvYAvUFTW2hbNvjVWBm1WBa6BF1ZMcA67_8D2-iBtlQqrw5x5b5kQ_oE2kCFa5L5cybPLls0UgrPCxrj1QQRE-j7F2r1AQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q1DaZ9EBXhk/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Hunting Sniper - The Ultimate Free Hunting Experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbark on a thrilling journey into the wild with Hunting Sniper, the premier free hunting game. Immerse yourself in the heart-pounding action of stalking and capturing wild animals in their natural habitats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnparalleled Wildlife Encounters\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a world teeming with real animals, each indigenous to their respective territories. Traverse diverse and authentic hunting locations spanning continents. Set your sights on a majestic big buck, a cunning fox, a ferocious coyote or a formidable bear in the rugged landscapes of Yellowstone Park, USA. Chasing the elusive zebras across the vast African savannah. Venturing into the dangerous rainforest, waiting for an agile tapir. Embarking on an enthralling mission in the expansive hinterlands to capture a fierce wildebeest, and prepare for many more extraordinary encounters. All of this right at your fingertips on your mobile device.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eArms and Arsenal\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMarvel at the extensive array of weaponry at your disposal in Hunting Sniper. Experience unparalleled precision, exquisite design, and unmatched quality that enhance your hunting expedition. Elevate your weapon\\u0026#39;s performance with weapon tokens, allowing you to tailor your arsenal to perfection. And that\\u0026#39;s not all - complement your gear with cutting-edge bullets bullets to unlock impressive rewards and secure the trophy of a lifetime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSeamless Gameplay Mastery\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRevolutionize your hunting experience with game controls that redefine excellence. Hunting Sniper\\u0026#39;s intuitive controls empower you to hunt with finesse and pinpoint accuracy. Say goodbye to frustrating gameplay experiences that leave you tempted to toss your smartphone aside. Engage in silky-smooth gun control, mirroring real-life precision.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Ultimate Hunter\\u0026#39;s Challenge\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRise through the ranks of the leaderboard and claim your title as the world\\u0026#39;s preeminent hunter. Hunting Sniper is the sole hunting game that boasts thrilling tournaments and championships. Hone your hunting prowess as you vie against fellow hunters in intense PvP battles. Prove yourself as the unrivaled deer hunting monarch, a title earned through sheer skill and determination.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSoar to New Heights\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you defy gravity and reach for the skies? As you immerse yourself in the captivating world of Hunting Sniper, you\\u0026#39;ll find yourself striving for new heights in the pursuit of greatness.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHunter\\u0026#39;s Delight\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThroughout your adventure, the captivating sights and sounds of the wild will surround you. The words \\u0026quot;deer\\u0026quot; and \\u0026quot;hunter\\u0026quot; will become your rallying cries as you aim for the ultimate hunting triumph. Will you seize the opportunity to become the ultimate predator and secure your place as the apex hunter? The call of the wild awaits – answer it with Hunting Sniper.\"],\"Sparks Info\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zISgYUTdsHtwPAY8ZYf3hF8mZuGGNGaVPG7uqPUWKCtZ6GF9LUPF0cChxPahb7IVOYxHjmqqMZx7K3FbIbD2Eg\"],null,[34,93,107,255]],null,[\"Rated for 16+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt\"]],[null,\"Strong Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,nu