able clothes, hairstyles, makeup, and even furniture! Deal with dramatic characters like egotistical fashion icons, scheming assistants, or stubborn clients in dire need of a new wardrobe. Play challenging fashion-themed puzzles to help find that perfect look! And don\\u0026#39;t forget to customize your own signature style with your avatar!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCHOOSE from lots of fashionable clothes to create the perfect look!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMAKEOVER helpless clients and give them the confidence to follow their dreams!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDECORATE a person\\u0026#39;s room as well as their appearance!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDRAMA is everywhere, be ready to meet some extreme personalities!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSOLVE addictive puzzles with challenging obstacles!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSTYLIZE your avatar to stand out on the red carpet!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVISIT FRIENDS and see how they dressed their avatar!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBLAST through levels with exciting power-ups with explosive benefits!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSupport: Dear Director, are you having problems with the game? Visit https://support.projectmakeover.com/ or contact us in-game by going to Settings \\u0026gt;Help \\u0026gt;Contact Us.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.projectmakeover.com/privacy-policy/\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.projectmakeover.com/terms-of-service/\"],\"Magic Tavern, Inc.\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nyu-UDM_-RHGULZBwmQcWmTn5vSAN1NFJcNuoQR-Jba7Q4sJ9BQLqx4DjEgfhHtVpFQCGdIDMcRN-W7vdzLYRw\"],null,[28,69,190,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://