2,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XU0aH4QrD_ZabuUN7cuFd3W9kntOrQKRN6Grqvn2FkEPCWZSp8FYeqSpYVaNFNOCpXgyvUQPrbTJda_OIC17\"]]],\"Her Comeback: Merge \\u0026 Story\",[\"4.8\",4.85],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.judian.hercomeback.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.judian.hercomeback.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.judian.hercomeback.gp\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIMEoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOwofChljb20uanVkaWFuLmhlcmNvbWViYWNrLmdwEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"0PnwZoZybeI\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:0PnwZoZybeI?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:0PnwZoZybeI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmcSd1UZLC40J5ETz_x3QxN8wagOngx2b51fM-sTD1yUkrgsJ2g90an6jy596SRMUq03Vg7uT6sySOZRxV6WcTqe7-NE5SdzfRZzmjWL89tNy6gGxc0kWrpVDX2H7g_vaVVVsv5KCA7BM7Sy5u6zWaTrWvjMFFAc5DDS9Kmqv6A0IC8epRJHBHM5Mz2cdI4a_GVqmi04ojzzPKwgWkVEv4UMXfc1zRmVOZv0jRodUvcGSBf-Rh3CU5eGxBavN7uq8pif1lMZ1mWXizzhKPxrlyvVS9E4ZrRhMHBRtbDa_PhqA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0PnwZoZybeI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Her Comeback: Merge \\u0026amp; Story — dive into the merge gameplay and start Molly\\u0026#39;s comeback journey in Coral Bay!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Molly\\u0026#39;s footsteps and witness how her life is completely rewritten after an accident.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAwaken Molly\\u0026#39;s culinary instincts through merging ingredients, restore the restaurant, create delicious dishes, and witness her growth.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery merge of ingredients and every delicious dish served pieces together fragmented memories, uncovers hidden truths, and lays the groundwork for Molly\\u0026#39;s comeback.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge to Unlock Delicious Magic:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe classic merge gameplay is easy to learn. Combine basic ingredients into high-grade materials, unlock a variety of dishes, complete cooking orders, and awaken hidden culinary talents throughout the journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDecorate the Dream Coastal Restaurant:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFreely choose decoration styles, upgrade kitchen facilities, and transform the dilapidated small restaurant into a popular landmark in Coral Bay step by step. Each renovation brings new changes to the restaurant and reveals more of Molly\\u0026#39;s story.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock the Past and Regain Her Life:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect clues through restaurant management and merge puzzles, gradually recover lost memories, find Molly\\u0026#39;s missing daughter, expose the conspiracy behind her past, and regain the glory of the \\u0026quot;Culinary Queen.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Visit our support page in the Her Comeback app or send us a message at contact@Judiangames.com.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://policy.judiangames.com/privacypolicy-index.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://policy.judiangames.com/termsofservice.html\"],\"Judian Technology International Pte. Ltd.\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/myyKMhmd28JznHYh88islvMK8HOzmi4DtUnkAaT_TZS8TctnGHfO8uR2bmetdMXlpEXyIsbrVaehZRcU21vfhA\"],null,[78,86,87,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003