/6000OaM9CB0z-XUVtzPlut464lfkzS5gqmP6IqZHrQS3B6EGnDiu8c_YVHv6JS1BCbGBvloyfxAuKWX3tA0a\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qkm0yMZ63Py58dMKPLAlgpWWyfux5SPpOE43hdJ7L79w6HpgaBKEUSQ6LHYifUYrPD0fcTLM8Wxtaingl2eknA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qv2hMoE-69BVjqazn54yeBlo552tJDTDuL_rgGa1XZgWHasye200W0T3Petnu6ZI1SGMLYEjSg8-gVFHc8Rvpg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CuQhFOHsR86D7mw0NkA4B6tfzLQPAVCB4ZODxp4Yssb1AWHinu9z7bmo4CsKhOOkLMhrFwPYNwwsJJnFQPIe\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lC5esXAMJEB5oaOEh87w9C5vs1uRtUObcay0-82ji2XB5vNXjLaqvqVdiPhnR4qC4vBI_AhiVV8qfYgrisT8\"]]],\"Merge World: Drama \\u0026 Story\",[\"4.1\",4.06],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.b25game.win.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.b25game.win.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.b25game.win.gp\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIM0oTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoYChJjb20uYjI1Z2FtZS53aW4uZ3AQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Runaway bride. Shattered dreams. A fierce comeback.\\u003cbr\\u003eHelp Kylie Donahue, heiress turned single mom, rebuild her life after betrayal, heartbreak, and scandal. Merge delicious dishes, decorate stunning scenes, and dive into dramatic stories packed with romance, revenge, and the fight to take control of her life—or maybe, discover the true love who’s been by her side all along.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBut Kylie’s journey is only the beginning—discover a world full of gripping tales, from secret identities to fiery love triangles, mysteries, rom-coms, and more. Every merge brings you closer to the next jaw-dropping twist!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch \\u0026amp; Merge for endless fun.\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge matching items to upgrade and fulfill orders. Experience the satisfaction of creating, discovering, and unlocking new items and chains as you progress!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnravel breathtaking stories that match every taste.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom kickass heroines and secret identities to fiery love triangles, mystery romances, and friends-to-lovers twists—Merge World offers a stunning variety of gripping dramas. With fresh characters and unpredictable plots, there’s always something new to read, play, and fall in love with.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExciting events, endless surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game features abundant in-game events of all kinds where players can earn bonus rewards, unlock special items, and enjoy unexpected surprises. Every event adds something fresh to the experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRestore charming scenes, one merge at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Ocean Funland and floating restaurants to grand outdoor musical banquets, dreamy wedding venues, and enchanting gardens—you’ll bring a variety of unique, fun-filled scenarios back to life through your merges.\"],\"MaxDrama\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aBvwRlxQn9YzGgIlN9tMbYrUZGsF7k6X120tE9oaKqS86Tb63w-QEIZQrGA4oLk6Hn7lrhd_Iq__z_NU-wMv\"],null,[32,208,222,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Horror\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,