king for a casual shooter to blast your stress away, look no further! 👀\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Beaver Squad is locked, loaded, and ready to show you their hilarious, unexpected charm!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠️ Merge, Upgrade, and Grow!\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom handguns to miniguns! Merge over 60 different types of weapons with a simple swipe.\\u003cbr\\u003eCombine the same weapons, and BOOM! Watch them transform into unimaginable heavy artillery.\\u003cbr\\u003eThanks to the easy-to-learn merge system, anyone can jump into this casual indie game!\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to get addicted to merging your way to the ultimate firepower?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Blast Away Your Stress! Action-Packed Combat\\u003cbr\\u003eJust look at the relentless shooting skills of our furry gunners!\\u003cbr\\u003eThe screen-shaking impact and satisfying hits will clear your mind instantly. The thrill of firing massive guns is totally off the charts!\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn’t just a cute game—it’s a true shooter alive with hardcore action!\\u003cbr\\u003eWipe out enemies with thrilling combat and enjoy the ultimate time-killer.\\u003cbr\\u003eHave you ever seen an idle shooter RPG this perfect?!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😎 Collect 40 Unique Fluffy Gunners\\u003cbr\\u003eSniper, shotgun, assault rifle... Collect over 40 different beaver agents, each with their own specialty!\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your very own dream squad and dive into chaotic, fun-filled battles.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the satisfaction of collecting your favorite beaver recruits!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😴 Grow Fast, Even in Your Sleep\\u003cbr\\u003eZero manual control fatigue! Enjoy the comfort of auto-battles where beavers use skills on their own.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe farming never stops, even when you\\u0026#39;re offline. This is the ultimate AFK idle game!\\u003cbr\\u003eWake up to a mountain of offline rewards and level up at lightning speed.\\u003cbr\\u003eA 100% stress-free time-killer with a growth system that plays itself even when you\\u0026#39;re busy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 Stuck? Prestige and Keep Adventuring!\\u003cbr\\u003eDon\\u0026#39;t be sad if a boss beats you! That\\u0026#39;s what our amazing Prestige system is for.\\u003cbr\\u003ePrestige to reset and gain permanent buffs, unleashing power on a whole new level!\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore diverse maps like lush forests, scorching deserts, and snowy fields as you embark on an epic adventure.\\u003cbr\\u003eWill you be the ultimate commander in this endless journey?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💞 Perfect for players who:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Are completely obsessed with cute animal characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Want a fast-growing idle game to fit their busy lifestyle.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Love clearing stress with satisfying, action-packed shooting.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy the addictive mechanics of merging and upgrading weapons.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Think \\u0026quot;chubby beavers firing machine guns\\u0026quot; is the greatest combo ever.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Rumble Beavers now and experience a world full of explosive, unexpected charm! 🎮🦫✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e-----\\u003cbr\\u003e📩 Support: support@neptunecompany.kr\\u003cbr\\u003e📄 Terms of Service: https://neptunecompany.kr/gameterms\\u003cbr\\u003e🔒 Privacy Policy: https://neptunecompany.kr/gameprivacy\"],\"NEPTUNE(TREEPLLA)\",\"1,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B4YpBzWaqLUIsc__9ef_DT5JQNvhxXkJHyAu7AvzXqd1SHWnaX3R_EkibAvghPrejZ9fkgrhPHbEQTuqf4S6\"],null,[123,121,123,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Som