d more.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍕 Equipment upgrades to help you become the master ovenist.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍕 Simple, fun and challenging cooking game.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍕 Created by pizza making professionals; the game designer worked in a pizza kitchen for four years!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you become the master ovenist? Only time and your pizza skills will tell! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload and start pizza making now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: \\u003cbr\\u003ehttp://www.tapblaze.com/about/privacy-policy/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: \\u003cbr\\u003ehttp://www.tapblaze.com/about/terms-conditions/\"],\"TapBlaze\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/llonn-neeTpjUBjNlbpuCwXG4110wGd1CA0qNwf_ACpLNi_YCOcPXMdtRtIku8syz6Ds6W73v-IeYpIqR7RFfw\"],null,[178,94,94,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tapblaze.pizzabusiness\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tapblaze.pizzabusiness\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"₱49.00 - ₱5,900.00 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,