ttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yeeha.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.yeeha.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yeeha.game\"]],[\"qgJeGlwIPEoTCJy9srHHkJcDFQicrAIdD7EeP/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMAoUCg5jb20ueWVlaGEuZ2FtZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Yeeha — Spin, Build, Raid \\u0026amp; Chat in Voice Rooms!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Yeeha, the ultimate social casual game where the thrill of spinning meets the joy of voice chatting! Spin the Slot Machine, build your dream islands, raid your friends\\u0026#39; treasures, and hang out in lively voice rooms with your exclusive pets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCore Gameplay: Spin, Build, Attack \\u0026amp; Raid!\\u003cbr\\u003e-  Spin the Slot Machine: Get free spins daily! Spin to win millions of Coins, earn Shields to protect your islands, or get energy refills.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Attack \\u0026amp; Raid: Hit the jackpot to attack other players\\u0026#39; islands or raid your friends\\u0026#39; coin stashes! Revenge is sweet, and stealing treasure is even sweeter.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Build Your Islands: Use your hard-earned coins to build and upgrade stunning MENA-themed islands, from the Egypt Pyramid Island to the UAE Sailboat Island.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBrand New Pet System\\u003cbr\\u003e- Adopt Exclusive Pets: Choose and adopt your very own pet, including rare SR pets like the \\u0026quot;Flame Leo\\u0026quot;.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Game Boosts: Your pets aren\\u0026#39;t just cute; they provide powerful in-game buffs, such as various honor identity skins!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Social Flex: Show off your pet in voice rooms with stunning Entrance Effects, display them in your Profile page, and unlock exclusive Avatar Cards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVoice Chat Rooms: Team Up \\u0026amp; Socialize\\u003cbr\\u003e- Desert Voice Tent: Jump into real-time voice chat rooms. Strategize with teammates, chat, laugh, and make new friends from around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Send Gifts: Use your wealth to send awesome virtual gifts during voice parties and become the center of attention!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with Friends\\u003cbr\\u003e- Invite your Facebook friends to join the fun. Form a \\u0026quot;Caravan\\u0026quot; to spin together for double rewards, or join a Tribe to defend your islands in epic \\u0026quot;Island Wars\\u0026quot;.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Grab massive friend red envelopes and celebrate together during festivals like Eid al-Fitr.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay for a Cause\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock 3 islands, and Yeeha donates real saplings for MENA desert reforestation through our Desert Afforestation Charity program.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImportant Notes\\u003cbr\\u003e- Yeeha is free to play on all devices, with optional in-app purchases available.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Yeeha is a social casual game designed for adult entertainment only. It does NOT offer real-money gambling or any opportunity to win real money or real-world prizes. All in-game currency (Gold Coins) is strictly virtual and non-withdrawable.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Practice or success at social casino gaming does not imply future success at real-money gambling.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect \\u0026amp; Support\\u003cbr\\u003e- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Yeehago/\\u003cbr\\u003e- Terms of Service: https://www.yeeha.app/servicePolicy/\\u003cbr\\u003e- Privacy Policy: https://www.yeeha.app/privacyPolicy/\\u003cbr\\u003e- Support: YeehaFeedback@unitylink.work\"],\"Unity Link Network Technology Limited\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SURYp-8WmpFoG4Pad5866XOgU7vaLElZekWvobhGnUhv4BtKwV9IERZCuU8Eubh0eggVvJPU5BapwvwG5_Y8UA\"],null,[86,209,250,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,