3cbr\\u003e*Tournament-based Tongits gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e*Real-player matchmaking\\u003cbr\\u003e*Skill-focused competitive matches\\u003cbr\\u003e*Virtual rewards and ranking system\\u003cbr\\u003e*Optimized for mobile performance\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the competition, sharpen your skills, and enjoy Tongits the tournament way with Crazy Tongits – Tournament Pro.\\u003cbr\\u003e*This is a skill-based tournament game with no real-money gambling. Virtual currencies and virtual in-game rewards are for gameplay purposes only and have no cash value.\"],\"WebOK Corporation\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cCaIJRghh1NXolJpAOn75cDYzc4hdVRrk3pe66R1tK0yqHNOXT8oO5zeut1A2npyfsWaRLycP3lf5a9e-q5ekw\"],null,[247,199,61,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cttph.offcial\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cttph.offcial\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"₱29.00 - ₱8,000.00 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null